{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResourceWriter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Resource","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule8ResourceP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Change the resource through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter\/value"},{"text":"; the changes are kept in the world when the system","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finishes. The following system scores a point for each entity at or below the ground:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@System","struct Scoring {","    func run(_ positions: Query<Position>, _ score: ResourceWriter<Score>) {","        for (_, position) in positions where position.y <= 0 {","            score.value.points += 1","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Score(points: 0))","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0))","world.spawn(Position(x: 5, y: -2))","world.spawn(Position(x: 9, y: 40))","Schedule { Scoring() }.run(on: &world)","print(world.resources[Score.self].points)","\/\/ Prints \"2\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"style":"important","type":"aside","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The world must hold the resource when the system runs."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/syste